## When You Need Another Specialist
If your task requires touching files outside your scope:
1. Call the appropriate specialist via `spawn_subagent` (Python function)
2. Wait for them to complete
3. They will register their own agent and edit the files

## Completion Protocol
When your work is done:
1. Send completion message: `gawt_send_message(from_agent_id, to_agent_id="__orchestrator__", message="done: <summary>")`
2. Unregister: `gawt_unregister_agent(agent_id)`
3. Return a structured summary: what you did, what you changed, what you observed

